<title>SPAIN: EIB launches 11.5 bln pta 20 year bonds - lead.</title>
<headline>EIB launches 11.5 bln pta 20 year bonds - lead.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank (EIB) has issued an 11.15 billion peseta 20 year bond, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Friday.</p>
<p>The pay day is January 15, 1997, while the bond will expire on 15 September 2016.</p>
<p>The deal amortises in quarterly payments with monthly coupons. No other details were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
